    "body": "This entry has two issues:\n\n1. **Wrong date**: `2024-05-18` is nearly 2 years in the past. All other entries in this file are from 2026. This should use the current date (approximately `2026-03-07`).\n\n2. **Wrong format**: This entry doesn't follow the established multi-line format used by all other entries in this file. It should have a blank line before the heading, use the path format (not bracket-delimited), and have `**Split:**` and `**Improvement:**` on separate lines without square brackets. See lines 81-84 for the immediately preceding entry as reference.\n```suggestion\n\n## 2026-03-07 - src-tauri/src/mcp/builtin/workspace/persistent_shell/tests\n\n**Split:** `session_tests.rs`, `manager_tests.rs`\n**Improvement:** Extracted large test suites to their own files, reducing file size and clutter in `session.rs` and `manager.rs`.\n```",
