    "body": "The code has inconsistent indentation. Line 1 has 4 leading spaces (`    use super::super::*;`) while line 2 has none (`use anyhow::Result;`). It looks like the test code was extracted from the `mod tests { ... }` block but the extra 4-space indentation was only partially removed — `use` imports on lines 2-3 were fixed, but line 1 and all test function bodies still carry the old inner indentation. This will cause `cargo fmt --check` to fail in CI. All lines in this file should be at the top indentation level (0 spaces for top-level items, standard nesting within functions).",
